interface.signature:
updateTokens(sessionId: string, tokensIn: number, tokensOut: number): Promise<void>
Atomic UpdateCommand: UpdateExpression: 'ADD tokensInAccumulated :i, tokensOutAccumulated :o' ConditionExpression: 'attribute_exists(sessionId)' ExpressionAttributeValues: { ':i': tokensIn, ':o': tokensOut }
No-op when both deltas are <= 0 or non-finite.

GET /api/free-agent/sessions/:id/audit
Auth: Bearer JWT required.
Authorization: caller.sub === session.operatorId OR admin scope.

Response 200:
{
  sessionId: string,
  session: {
    status, model, costCapUsd, costUsdAccumulated,
    tokensInAccumulated, tokensOutAccumulated,
    turnCount, createdAt, lastActivityAt, lastTurnAt?,
    claudeSessionId?, errorReason?
  },
  events: [
    { timestamp: ISO-8601, kind: string, detail: object }
  ]
}

Errors:
  400 InvalidInput   — sessionId fails validation
  403 Forbidden      — non-owner non-admin
  404 NotFound       — session not found
